WEBVTT

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:06.790
After the other day, Hana-san left as our overseer,

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:10.720
and the vice president only comes by the trash area occasionally.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.310
So...

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.690
today, at last...

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.320
Kiyoshi-dono,

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.620
go through the hole
and look around today.

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:53.350
A practice run, right?

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:55.670
Endeavor to stay out for an hour.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.330
A whole hour?

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:00.080
You'll have to do so for three hours on the actual day.

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:01.520
That's true.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.340
It's not that long in comparison.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:06.770
But be back here by
the time the bell rings.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.090
Got it.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:13.170
For Mari to have seen my
collection not once, but twice now,

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.970
I'm a failure as a father...

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.060
right?

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:20.480
As both an educator and a father, I must seal these...

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.480
away!

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.620
Guess I should check my escape route.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.610
The train station is... over there.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:42.960
You crappy couple! Just you watch!

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:45.700
Next week I'm putting the moves on Chiyo-chan,

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.670
just enough so that she's not
turned off by me, you got that?!

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:49.260
The chairman?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.180
Where's Kiyoshi?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.920
Kiyoshi-dono is working in the back.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.340
Shall I summon him for you?

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.620
No, it's fine. Keep working.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.110
That was surprisingly easy.

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:10.570
Isabel, summer of '86, Brazil.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.530
Yours was a fine behind. I shan't forget you.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.480
Evita, autumn of '87, Argentina.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.540
What the hell is he doing?
Evita, autumn of '87, Argentina.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.710
And how long is he
going to stay here for?

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.440
I hope he hurries up.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.460
Oh no! Time's up!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.370
Hey, is Kiyoshi still back there?

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:29.960
Yes, he is.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.130
Kiyoshi! Show yourself!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.470
Kiyoshi-dono! What are you doing?!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:37.710
Answer me!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.180
I shall go and bring him!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.310
No. I'll go.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.770
Kiyoshi-dono, get back here posthaste!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.200
Farewell, my beloved bottoms.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.360
He finally left!

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:00.370
How?! On the way out I
slipped right through!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.910
Hurry!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.250
It's no use!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.380
I guess it's all over!

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:11.000
Vice President! Have you been hurt?!

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.850
Kiyoshi! If you're there, then answer me!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:16.780
I'm sorry.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.680
And <i>you</i> make sure to put this in order!

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.850
For heaven's sake...

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.340
Kiyoshi-dono! What in
blazes were you doing?!

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.420
Well, it's kind of a long story.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.980
I had to use the ploy I was saving for the real deal already.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.270
Huh? You mean, that was you?

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:34.710
Now I must concoct another contrivance.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.860
Also, the hole has to be a bit bigger.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.410
I got stuck halfway through.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.910
Ugh, I'd like to watch some commercial TV for once.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.130
We have to think up some way to keep the overseers hoodwinked

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.890
for an entire three hours, sometime before <i>that</i> day.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.800
As for the hole, one more day should be enough to widen—

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:53.630
Yo!

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:54.880
Whatcha talking about?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.770
Huh? Oh, nothing much.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.150
You two sure seem to be getting along well lately.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.480
Is that right?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.030
I mean, we <i>are</i> working together now, so...

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:03.850
Hmm...

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:08.810
I'm here for the purchase request forms I gave you the other day.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:14.030
Wh-What are you
wearing, Vice President?!

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.860
These are my night clothes!
Now, submit the forms at once!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.110
Kiyoshi asks for a dictionary. No problem.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:22.080
For Andre, a KGB48 pencil board. Denied.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.180
For Shingo, hair gel. Denied.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.730
For Joe, an ant farm set? We'll consider it.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.290
For Gakuto, a pocket audio player. Denied.

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:32.160
Wait, that's for my English listening practice!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.450
Really? Then we will consider it.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:35.510
Much obliged.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.590
Okay, I'm posting next month's schedule.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.580
Her boobs and panties
are always on display,

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.140
so we don't notice
it that much anymore,

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.000
but she really is amazing.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.600
Somehow, covering it up like this makes it even more indecent.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.930
Yours truly is a huge fan of tank tops and hot pants!

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:52.610
I wanna kiss that ass.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.940
All right, everyone check it.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.190
Excuse me, Vice President?

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.310
What?

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:00.570
Next Saturday's work
isn't the same as always?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.820
It'll be as written there.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:05.070
The track club's regional meet is being held on that day.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.060
Instead of your normal work, you'll be helping with that.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.270
Um, I have a question!

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:09.870
What?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.040
What exactly is the nature of this work, and where will we be laboring?

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:14.870
That day, you will split up,

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.550
three of you will be watching belongings,
the other two will do miscellaneous jobs.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.590
Kiyoshi, Gakuto, and Shingo, are on belongings detail.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.820
Andre and Joe are assigned to miscellaneous detail.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.720
The three of us, huh?

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:27.460
Gakuto...

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:31.220
apparently, we'll be working
in front of that restroom.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:31.940
Mm-hmm.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.590
Being separated from the trash site is a major quandary.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.570
How will you be able to reach the hole?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.280
And furthermore...

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.110
Hey, I'm looking forward to Saturday.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.360
Let's have a blast together.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.170
What do we do about Shingo-dono?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.120
I won't be able to leave our post with him around.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.710
Is it possible that Shingo-dono is cognizant of our ploy?

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.540
It does seem like he
suspects us of something.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.710
At this point, we have to seriously consider bringing Shingo in on it.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:01.250
Come to think of it, I haven't spoken with Kiyoshi much lately.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.050
So, room to squeeze in another?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.810
We can't possibly.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.550
Sure we can. Shingo's not...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.400
Shingo's not...

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.020
<i>that</i> big a tight-ass.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.770
Tight asses, and squeezing things in?!

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:16.080
Shingo-dono has no motive to back our escape plan, though.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.440
He wanted some hair gel, right?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.990
I bet some gel will do the trick.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.300
It couldn't be...!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:26.200
What are they greasing up with gel,
and where are they squeezing it into?!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.790
That was some conversation earlier.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.470
I have heard it's common in prison...

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.100
But no, I probably misheard them.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.700
I've known Kiyoshi since middle school.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.210
He's not that kind of guy.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.300
So, what do we do about Shingo?

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:45.640
Kiyoshi-dono, I just have to slip in front of you, here...

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.470
That's nice.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:50.930
"That's nice"?! Is Gakuto really that good?!

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:54.890
Hey, are you okay?

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:56.240
No!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.110
No, no, no!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.420
I'm sure I'm just seeing things!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.530
You're overthinking it,
Shingo! There's no way!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:04.320
Ugh, that hurts...

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.780
Oh, no! Did he hear...

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.160
...what we were conversing about?

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.120
They're hardcore!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:14.000
They've totally got
their eyes on me, now!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:17.920
Oh, Shingo-dono! Come on in and shower with us!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:21.760
Don't just stand over there, come on in.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:25.120
Yours truly will wash your back for you.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.960
No... I think I'm good today...

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:27.640
Why not?

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:28.800
Come on in!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:32.720
You're the one who said you looked forward to the three of us having a blast together, Shingo-dono.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.520
I didn't mean it like that! I'm sorry!

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.080
This is my bad! So, count me out!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:37.520
Wait, Shingo!

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.400
Shingo-dono!

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.030
Vice President!

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:43.490
What?

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.360
It's about Saturday's work assignments!

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.820
The miscellaneous jobs
seem like more work,

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.790
so I'd like to help out with those!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.920
Very well. Permission granted.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:52.790
Thank you very much!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.710
I wonder what's come over Shingo.

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:55.670
Indeed.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.500
Who knows why, but thank goodness.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:02.340
The issue remains, how will you reach the hole from this post?

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:06.220
How do I move from this
restroom to the hole, unseen?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.460
I can't just cut across the school grounds, after all.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:13.820
What's this?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.900
Hmm? Perhaps I'm imagining things,

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.810
but I thought I just heard
Kiyoshi-dono's voice.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.850
I must say, his lavatory break has grown protracted.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:23.820
Gakuto...

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.260
Down here. Here.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:32.240
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.380
You idiot! Not so loud!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.740
My apologies.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:36.410
I've found it.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:40.580
A way to get here from our watching post unseen.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:44.770
This drainage shaft runs
throughout the school grounds,

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.470
and it's just barely wide enough
for a person to crawl through it.

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:51.090
I crawled my way over here from behind the restroom.

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.120
That's uncharacteristically nice
thinking from you, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.310
That "uncharacteristically" was uncalled-for.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:59.510
For now, let me go back to the restroom and return normally.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:07.730
Imagine, Kiyoshi-kun and Gakuto-kun having a physical relationship.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:08.360
Shocking.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.110
Huh?!

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:12.620
The truth is, I thought they'd
been acting suspicious lately.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:16.580
Then, just as I feared, I saw Gakuto
going down on Kiyoshi in the shower.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.290
What are you talking about, Shingo, you bastard?!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:21.190
I just couldn't believe it,

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:23.190
so I went and took another look.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.650
Huh? There's more?

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.250
You're not saying...

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:27.920
Yeah, I <i>am</i> saying.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.480
I saw Kiyoshi drilling into Gakuto.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.140
Even though Gakuto said it hurt.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.860
So then, Kiyoshi-kun's a pitcher.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:35.720
And Gakuto's a catcher.

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.680
You've gotta be kidding me!
I'm a virgin, for both of those things!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.350
Well, even if those two are really close, in more ways than one,

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.150
they're still invaluable buds to me.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.110
Why are you slacking off?!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:52.030
This angle is...

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.410
amazing!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.600
Hmph, guess I'll keep going.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:01.460
She's gonna do more Hindu squats, right here?!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.810
The vice president's nethers are
moving away... then moving closer...

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:08.460
moving away... moving closer...

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:11.260
away... closer...

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:14.970
If Kiyoshi-dono doesn't come
back soon, he'll raise suspicions!

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.860
moving closer... moving away...

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.750
closer... awa—

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:20.450
No!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.310
It's beyond amazing, but if I don't get back soon, I'll be in it deep!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.330
Hmm, must have stepped on a rat or something.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.360
What a gross sensation.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.470
Today's work is hereby at an end.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:34.530
But before you go,

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.290
there's something I want to ask.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.910
Kiyoshi, step forward.

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.030
Yes?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.680
You were in the restroom
an awfully long time.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.070
Were you skipping work?

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.830
No, I wouldn't do that.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.920
Kiyoshi-dono has a delicate stomach.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.240
Is this true?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.550
You've never been in
there that long before.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.170
Um, Vice President,

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.760
Kiyoshi having a delicate
stomach is actually not true.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:55.770
Huh?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.590
What are you saying?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.050
The truth is,

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.890
he has hemorrhoids.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.230
Where did all this blood come from?! Oh, right!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.140
Earlier, when I got stomped on by the vice president's heel!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.050
So he's not just a pitcher, huh?

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.090
He's a catcher, too.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.110
He didn't have to go <i>that</i> hard, though.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.940
Hmm?

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.950
The items you requested the other day have arrived.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.160
Come and take them.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.740
Now I can do my English listening practice!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.290
You sure like studying.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.170
What are you talking about? This is—

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:26.950
Oh, right.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:30.960
You'll be taking tomorrow's I.T. class in the computer lab with the girls.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.300
Unfortunately, the prison doesn't have its own computers.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.290
Behave yourselves tomorrow.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.230
All right!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.080
Together with the girls!

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.140
Es puta!

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:44.690
We made it, Gakuto!
We're in with the girls!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.100
Just as I had conjectured.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:47.980
What are you talking about?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.380
This contingency plan.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.110
Huh?

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.070
Despicable.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:52.900
This really sucks.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:53.740
They smell!

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.970
I was thrilled for a second there...

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:57.980
But this is pretty tough.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.180
Huh? You think?

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.080
I can't resist this feeling of being scorned.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:04.620
Chiyo-chan...

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.580
I'm looking forward to Saturday.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.540
Mm-hmm, I'm looking forward, too.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.700
Gakuto, what's the contingency plan?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.170
Kiyoshi-dono, after you've gone to the lavatory,

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:19.470
yours truly shall play back the sounds of defecation placed on this player by remote control.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.080
By doing so, we can buy some time.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.560
Leave it to the most resourceful general in Nerima. The poop sounds are on it already, right?

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:26.350
Not yet.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:26.850
Huh?

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:28.600
Do you not get it yet?

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:32.730
When composing this plan, yours truly even
thought about how we would take this class!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.610
Is that... the net?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:35.630
Indeed.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.450
I should find a large number of poop sounds on the net.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:42.010
Searching for "poop mp3" returned nothing!

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.910
What do we do? We can't miss this chance,

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.480
we won't be touching a computer again!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.130
I am conscious of that!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.120
But no matter what I search for, nothing comes out!

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:51.080
But if nothing comes out...

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:53.370
...we must make our own come out.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.710
No, that's impossible. It's way too risky.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.430
Besides, which one of us would do it?

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.920
But there is no other way.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.530
It's okay, just give it up.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.050
This plan's a bust.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:09.730
Kiyoshi-dono, is that how lowly you regard your sumo date?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:13.060
These headphones also
work as a microphone.

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:16.530
Gakuto, don't!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:19.060
Do you know what will happen to you if you do this?!

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:21.950
It may indeed be too much to ask of you, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.650
If you did so in front of Chiyo-dono, your date will surely be ruined,

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.700
and you would have no true reason to break out.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:29.460
It's not just me, you can't do it, either.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.970
Are you planning to ruin three years of high school?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:36.750
Yours truly thought that if he went to a school with so many girls, he could find a girlfriend.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:40.050
Over three years, you can!
There are a thousand girls here!

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:43.560
However, those Three Kingdoms
figurines come once every four years.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.640
The math is simple.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:50.100
It is manifestly easier to endure three years than it is four.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.490
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.010
You'd rather have a figurine than a high school life?!

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.230
Beyond a doubt.

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:57.530
Stop! Think it over!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.700
If we were in grade school, maybe, but not a chance in high school!

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:03.410
Kiyoshi-dono, I leave the rest to you.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:04.570
Gakuto!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:06.410
Forgive me.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:17.500
Sensei!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.320
Please allow me to go to the lavatory.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.890
Of course, go right ahead.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.050
But you should have
asked a little sooner.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:27.310
Gakuto, I swear I'll break out successfully!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:30.180
Hey, four-eyes, what's the meaning of those pants?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.750
They are due to ineluctable circumstances.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.120
What ineluctable circumstances are those?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.150
Well, I...

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.090
I asked you what they are!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:42.990
Yours truly... soiled his pants... in the middle of class.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.140
You did what?

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.760
You're a high-schooler,
and yet you crapped yourself?

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:49.330
Is your bunghole really that loose? Eh?

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.700
Yes, quite loose...

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.680
That's some nice verbal abuse.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.440
It got that loose thanks to Kiyoshi's junk.

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:57.420
Hey, stop it!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.620
Vice President, is there anything else?

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.510
I'd like to get to work right away.

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:04.380
Begin. Stick a plug up
your butt if you have to.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.290
A plug? Like Kiyoshi's junk?

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:06.890
Stop it!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.990
What's so funny?!

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:11.220
Is having one of your buddies picked on really that funny?!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:13.500
Sorry. Joe made me laugh.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.690
Don't be so angry.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.040
It is all right, Kiyoshi-dono.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.650
I was prepared for this much.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:24.570
What a weak-willed man I...

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.530
am!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:30.120
I mean, to dig up the ladies that I had said farewell to, once and for all...

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:37.660
Surely enough, I must completely, utterly, and irrevocably lock them away forever.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.290
As an educator, as a father—

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.960
No, as a <i>man,</i> I must draw the...

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:43.420
line!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:47.800
Gakuto, they have no idea what a sacrifice you made.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:53.580
I had anticipated as much, but being berated for soiling oneself truly is onerous.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.310
Gakuto,

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:59.270
I will not let the poop sound that cost you three years of high school life to obtain go to waste.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:05.240
Let us make sure that this
breakout mission is successful!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:11.620
It would seem that my idea to
bury them was not good enough.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.370
This time, it really is <i>adios</i>.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.290
On the day of the mission,
we will not be at the trash site,

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.920
but watching belongings next to the
restroom adjacent to the sports ground.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.380
At the noon bell, you will enter the
drainage shaft behind the restroom,

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.310
and crawl through to the trash site.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.190
Then,

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.110
you slip out through the hole, outside school grounds.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.640
This phase must be executed in under 15 minutes.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:41.360
Then I go to the train station and reach Ryogoku Gymnasium, where Chiyo-chan is waiting, by 1:00.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:45.050
You will watch the sumo matches with Chiyo-dono for 30 minutes, and then move on to Akihabara.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.260
There, you obtain the figurines that yours truly desires.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.360
If you board the train just after 2:00, you can be back here by 3:00.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:54.050
While I'm on the outside,
you'll trick the vice president,

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:57.160
who will be on patrol, with the poop
sound you worked so hard to prepare.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:58.870
It's perfect.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:06.760
I'm going to go check the size of the hole,
and the route to the train station one more time.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.350
Yeah, that's good thinking.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:10.680
What is...

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:12.430
this?

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.930
Our school is starting to deteriorate quite badly.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.890
This curry is great!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.290
Yeah. I wish I could get seconds.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.310
Good... and spicy.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:24.690
Could the Underground Student Council have caught on to our plan?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.870
If they had, they would have disciplined us directly.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.950
It's more likely that the school staff found the hole.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:31.460
What do we do now?

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:36.140
If you had checked before the cement hardened, you could have dug it back out again, but...

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.910
What? Are you saying it's my fault for not checking?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.120
Kiyoshi-dono, checking the hole was <i>your</i> obligation.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.730
Hey, are you dumping all the responsibility on me?

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:45.820
You're awful.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.710
You are correct.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.480
Yours truly is an awful man.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.220
I mean, in full public view...

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:53.090
I went and soiled my pants!

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:59.270
I soiled myself, and wasted three years of high school.

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:00.640
Everything rested on this!

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.110
Now that I cannot acquire my quadrennial figurines,

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:06.600
that means I've wasted
a total of seven years!

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.400
No, I think your math is off, isn't it?

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:09.890
What's off about it?!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.780
For what, and for whom did yours truly soil his pants?!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.320
It's Kiyoshi's fault.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.240
It's his fault for overdoing
it and getting loose.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.350
Calm down! Lower your voice!

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:20.200
Yours truly wants his feces back!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.580
Shut up!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.210
What is all the racket in here?!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.880
Eat your food quietly!

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.840
Hey, guys, enough of this lover's spat.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.970
Cut it out! We are <i>not</i> like that!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.550
Hey, now, you two can
drop the act already.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:36.670
There's a reason for all this!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:39.680
So what is this reason? Tell us.

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.150
There's no way I can tell them.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.320
Hey, Joe, don't make him say it out loud.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.600
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.480
Don't let it bother you.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.790
We're behind you two, all the way.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.480
Damn these guys!

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:57.100
Yours truly wants his feces back!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.120
Gakuto sure seems down in the dumps.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.240
Wanna go talk to him?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:19.010
No, don't. This ain't our battle to fight.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.840
What is it?

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:23.480
You know...

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.560
when you messed your
pants up, I made up my mind...

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:29.130
to break out, no matter what.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.360
It's all over now.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.010
Yours truly's adolescence, and the breakout mission.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:37.070
No, it's not over yet.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.880
Now that the hole has been
blocked up, it is impossible!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:43.520
Our whole plan was conceived with that hole at its center!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:47.180
There is no time now
to think up another plan.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:47.880
There's a way.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.670
I will play the opposite sex!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:52.800
He's declaring himself the catcher!

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:55.720
I thought about it all night.

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.140
I don't think there's any other way.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.460
A breakout through the front gate.

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.720
You don't mean... When you said you'd play the opposite sex...!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.640
Yes. I'll dress up as a girl,

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.210
and walk proudly out the front gate.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.250
That would be rash!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.360
I know it's rash.

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:13.480
But this is the only chance we have.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.440
How will you even
secure a girl's uniform?

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.080
This is a boarding school,

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.520
so a cleaning service comes by every weekend to get the laundry, right?

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:22.580
Indeed so.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:26.880
That service parks at the dorm's rear entrance, just beyond those tanks.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.890
Friday, the day after tomorrow, while the cleaners are working,

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:33.460
I'll sneak in and borrow a girl's uniform.

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:36.030
The uniform's owner won't wear it over the weekend,

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:37.800
so if I get it back by Sunday night, they won't find out.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:39.640
Nonetheless...

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:43.140
Hey! This is the only chance left we have at a breakout!

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:45.420
You want those Three Kingdoms figurines, right?

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:46.730
Uh, well...

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:47.640
Then make up your mind!

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.320
We just have to wait for
the right time to act.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.610
We can't let the Underground Student Council suspect anything.

00:21:56.070 --> 00:21:57.100
You filthy four-eyes!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.900
What do you call this lumber stacking?!

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:00.970
Ow!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.450
Stand up, already.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:06.910
Yes.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:13.330
I said stand up, you piece of crap!

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:14.840
I am so sorry.

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:17.340
Please forgive my repeated boorishness!

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.550
What on earth is Gakuto up to?

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:25.340
Hey, are you okay?

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.020
I thought we were
going to lay low today.

00:22:27.020 --> 00:22:31.400
Not yet. It's still not quite enough yet.

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:33.810
The student council president...

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:36.280
It's the only way!

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:38.320
Vice President!

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.820
I want you to forgive yours truly!

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:42.740
I said that was enough!

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:44.160
Get back to work, you...

00:24:35.830 --> 00:24:37.690
Next time on Prison School:

00:24:38.300 --> 00:24:40.160
"Take Me Out to the Sumoland."
